# Vantage Movers Clients — Project Organization

`vantage-movers-clients` is a **pnpm + Turborepo monorepo** for Vantage Home Movers' public, lead-capture marketing sites. It contains **two independent Next.js apps** that share workspace packages but deploy to **separate Vercel projects** with different production domains.

Neither app has a database — copy lives in each app's source tree, and leads go to `vantage-main-server` via the shared `@vantage/api-client` package (server-only).

## Monorepo Layout

```
vantage-movers-clients/
├── apps/
│   ├── clients/       @vantage/clients   — partner landing pages
│   └── main-site/     @vantage/main-site — Vantage organic main site
├── packages/
│   ├── api-client/    @vantage/api-client — server-only backend seam
│   ├── styles/        @vantage/styles     — brand tokens, base CSS, Tailwind preset
│   └── utils/         @vantage/utils       — shared helpers (cn)
├── turbo.json
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml
└── package.json       root scripts (turbo orchestration)
```

`vantage-main-server` and `vantage-admin` live in **separate repositories** — do not add them here.

## Two Apps, Two Deployments

| | **`apps/clients`** | **`apps/main-site`** |
|---|---|---|
| Package | `@vantage/clients` | `@vantage/main-site` |
| Purpose | Partner / affiliate landing pages (Top10, TBM, TBM Prime) plus legacy root landing | Full Vantage organic homepage — services, coverage map, FAQ, about |
| Dev port | `3000` (`pnpm dev:clients`) | `3001` (`pnpm dev:main-site`) |
| Vercel root | `apps/clients` | `apps/main-site` |
| GitHub secret | `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_MOVERS_CLIENTS` | `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_MOVERS_MAIN_SITE` |
| Production domain | `vantagequotes.com` | `vantagehomemovers.com` |
| CI workflows | `.github/workflows/vercel-movers-clients-*.yml` | `.github/workflows/vercel-movers-main-site-*.yml` |

Each app has its own `vercel.json` with `git.deploymentEnabled: false` — deploys run via GitHub Actions (prebuilt `vercel build` + `vercel deploy` from the **repo root**, not from inside the app folder).

In each Vercel project: set **Root Directory** to the app path, enable **Include source files outside of the Root Directory in the Build Step** (required for workspace packages).

## Stack & Conventions (both apps)

- **Next.js 16.2** App Router, **React 19**, **Tailwind CSS 4**, React Compiler (`reactCompiler: true`).
- Forms: **React Hook Form + Zod 4** (`@hookform/resolvers/zod`). Icons: **lucide-react**.
- Vercel telemetry: `<Analytics />` and `<SpeedInsights />` mounted once in each app's root `layout.tsx`.
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`. Package manager: **pnpm** at the monorepo root.
- Next.js docs for this version live in repo-root `.next-docs/` — see `NEXTJS_AGENTS.md` before assuming older Next APIs.

### Workspace commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev              # both apps via Turborepo
pnpm dev:clients      # localhost:3000
pnpm dev:main-site    # localhost:3001
pnpm build            # build all
pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck
```

Per-app env files: `apps/clients/.env` and `apps/main-site/.env` (copy from repo-root `.env` when setting up).

### Shared packages

```ts
import { getTestimonials, createFormLead } from "@vantage/api-client";
import { cn } from "@vantage/utils";
```

```css
@import "@vantage/styles/base.css";   /* used by clients; main-site has its own @theme tokens */
```

Both apps list `@vantage/api-client` and `@vantage/utils` in `next.config.ts` `transpilePackages`.

