## App: `apps/clients` — Partner Landing Pages

**Lead-capture landing pages** for affiliate partners. Same section-based layout across routes; partner identity comes from the URL slug.

### Folder ownership

| Path | Owns |
|------|------|
| `src/app/` | Routes, root `layout.tsx`, `globals.css` imports, route handlers, PDF redirect routes |
| `src/components/` | React UI — keep pages thin, compose here |
| `src/content/` | Static copy, nav links, partner config, legal doc data, promo toggles |
| `src/schemas/` | Zod schemas shared by client form + API routes (`quote-form.schema.ts`) |
| `src/lib/` | Pure helpers (`format`, `estimate`, `analytics`) |
| `src/hooks/` | Client hooks (`useStickyHeader`, `usePromoTrigger`, scroll/lock helpers) |
| `src/types/` | Shared domain TypeScript types (`SiteConfig`, `LegalDoc`, `SceneName`, etc.) |
| `src/styles/` | Feature CSS imported by `globals.css` — **not** all-in-Tailwind |
| `public/` | Images, partner SVGs (`partnerlogos/`), FMCSA PDFs (`pdfs/`), brand assets |

### Key components

- **`LandingPage.tsx`** — orchestrates the full homepage; partner pages reuse it with a different `source`.
- **`layout/`** — `LicenseBar`, `Header` (resolves partner from pathname), `Footer`, `Logo`.
- **`sections/`** — landing blocks (`Hero`, `Services`, `Testimonials`, banners, CTAs). Read copy from `content/`.
- **`quote-form/`** — multi-step quote UI; posts to `/api/quote`. Uses Google Places autocomplete via `/api/places/*`.
- **`ui/`** — primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `Select`, `ImageFill`, `Phone`, `Icon`).
- **`policy/`** — `PolicyPage` renders `LegalDoc` from `content/legal/*`.
- **`promo/`** — `PromoProvider` + modal; config in `content/promo.ts`.
- **`analytics/`** — client-only tracking (`BounceTracker`). Do not mount Speed Insights here.
- **`interactive/`** — sitewide scroll/reveal UX (`RevealManager`, `BackToTop`).

### Route surface

**Landing pages** (async Server Components → fetch testimonials → `<LandingPage />`):

- `/` — canonical Vantage landing (`MAIN_SITE` from `content/partners.ts`)
- `/tbm`, `/tbm-primes`, `/top10` — partner landings; same sections, different `source_company` + header logo

**Legal pages** — thin `page.tsx` + `PolicyPage` + metadata from `content/legal/*`:

- `/privacy`, `/terms`, `/sms-privacy`, `/sms-terms`, `/cancellation`

**PDF shortcuts** (route handlers redirect to `/public/pdfs/`):

- `/ready-to-move`, `/your-rights`

**API route handlers**:

- `POST /api/quote` — validate with `quoteFormSchema`, `createFormLead()` (non-blocking on failure), return `estimate()` JSON
- `GET /api/places/autocomplete`, `GET /api/places/details` — server-side Google Places (ZIP autocomplete)

### Partner / lead source model

`content/partners.ts` maps URL slug → API payload:

- `sourceCompany` must match `vantage-main-server` `SOURCE_COMPANIES` (`main_site`, `tbm_leads`, `tbm_prime_leads`, `top10_leads`).
- `Header` calls `resolvePartner(pathname)`; `QuoteForm` sends `source_company` + `source_company_site` on submit.
- Adding a partner: entry in `PARTNERS`, new `src/app/<slug>/page.tsx`, logo under `public/partnerlogos/`.

### Styling (clients)

Hybrid CSS — do **not** convert existing sections to utility-only Tailwind.

- `globals.css` imports: `@vantage/styles/base.css`, `primitives.css`, `sections.css`, `quote-form.css`, `promo.css`, `policy.css`.
- Semantic BEM-like classes: `.hero__*`, `.qf__*` (quote form), `.p-*` (policy), `.btn`, `.wrap`.
- Fonts: Archivo (headings) + Public Sans (body) in root layout.

