## App: `apps/main-site` — Vantage Organic Main Site

**Single-page marketing site** for Vantage Movers' owned organic traffic. Richer information architecture than partner landings — coverage map, FAQ accordion, services dropdown, multi-section scroll experience.

### Folder ownership

| Path | Owns |
|------|------|
| `src/app/` | Root route, `layout.tsx`, `globals.css` (@theme tokens), API route handlers |
| `src/components/` | `HomePage` orchestrator + layout, sections, interactive widgets, UI primitives |
| `src/lib/content.ts` | **All** site copy and structured data (business info, services, FAQ, testimonials fallback, etc.) |
| `src/content/partners.ts` | Lead source config (`MAIN_SITE` only — `source_company: main_site`) |
| `src/schemas/` | Quote form Zod schema (`quote-form.schema.ts`) |
| `src/lib/` | Helpers (`format`, `estimate`, `images`, `icons`) |
| `public/` | Main-site images and brand assets |

### Key components

- **`HomePage.tsx`** — composes all homepage sections in order.
- **`layout/`** — `ComplianceBar`, `Header`, `Footer`, `Logo`.
- **`sections/`** — `HeroSection`, `TrustBand`, `ServicesSection`, `CoverageSection`, `HowItWorksSection`, `WhyVantageSection`, `AboutSection`, `TestimonialsSection`, `FaqSection`, `FinalCTASection`.
- **`interactive/`** — `QuoteWizard` (hero-embedded multi-step form), `CoverageMap` (USA SVG map), `ServicesDropdown`, `FaqAccordion`.
- **`ui/`** — `Container`, `Eyebrow`, `RollingNumber`, `Stars`, `ImageTile`, `CheckListItem`.

### Route surface

- `/` — single homepage (`HomePage` with live testimonials from API)

**API route handlers** (same contract as clients):

- `POST /api/quote`
- `GET /api/places/autocomplete`, `GET /api/places/details`

No legal pages, promo modal, or partner slug routes in this app.

### Styling (main-site)

Tailwind-first with inline `@theme` tokens in `globals.css` (brand blues/yellows, cream surfaces, display/body font vars). Fonts: Bricolage Grotesque (display) + Hanken Grotesk (body). Does **not** use the clients BEM section CSS files.

