## Backend Boundary (`@vantage/api-client`)

- **Only** `packages/api-client/src/index.ts` talks to `vantage-main-server` (`import "server-only"`).
- Both apps import from `@vantage/api-client` — there is no per-app `lib/vantage/server.ts`.
- Env: `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` (required), `VANTAGE_API_BASE_URL`, optional `FORM_LEAD_ROUTE`.
- Uses `x-api-secret` header. **Never** expose the secret or call the backend directly from client components.
- `getTestimonials()` — cached fetch, returns `[]` on failure (static fallback copy in each app's UI).
- `createFormLead()` — called from each app's `/api/quote`; lead failure is logged but must not block the estimate response.

## Environment Variables (per app)

Set in `apps/clients/.env` and/or `apps/main-site/.env` (and matching Vercel project env):

| Variable | Scope | Purpose |
|----------|-------|---------|
| `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` | server | Backend auth |
| `VANTAGE_API_BASE_URL` | server | API host (defaults to `https://vantage-movers-main-server.vercel.app`) |
| `FORM_LEAD_ROUTE` | server | Override form-lead path |
| `GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON` | server | Places autocomplete/details |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_PROMO_*` | client | Promo modal toggles — **clients app only** (`content/promo.ts`) |

## Out of Scope / Do Not Use

- `estimate()` in each app's `lib/estimate.ts` — placeholder pricing math, not production rates.
- `MOVE_SIZES` in each app's `schemas/quote-form.schema.ts` must stay aligned with `vantage-main-server` — no client-side remapping.
- No auth, no Mongo, no admin dashboard — that lives in `vantage-admin` / `vantage-main-server`.

## Quick "Where Do I…?"

| Task | App | Start here |
|------|-----|------------|
| Edit partner landing copy / add partner route | clients | `content/*`, `components/sections/*`, `content/partners.ts` |
| Change phone, license, disclaimer (landings) | clients | `content/site.ts` |
| Add/edit legal page | clients | `content/legal/<slug>.ts`, `app/<slug>/page.tsx`, `content/navigation.ts` |
| Edit main site copy (services, FAQ, about) | main-site | `lib/content.ts` |
| Change quote validation or steps | either | `schemas/quote-form.schema.ts` + quote form component in that app |
| Wire new lead field to CRM | either | schema → `app/api/quote/route.ts` → `CreateFormLeadInput` in `@vantage/api-client` |
| Style a clients landing section | clients | matching file in `src/styles/`, tokens from `@vantage/styles/base.css` |
| Style a main-site section | main-site | Tailwind classes + `@theme` tokens in `globals.css` |
| Promote Storybook Playground choices to production | main-site | See `.cursor/rules/storybook-promote-to-production.mdc` — read `Playground.args` in `src/stories/*.stories.tsx`, follow `*Preview.tsx` + resolvers |
| Change shared backend API calls | both | `packages/api-client/src/index.ts` |
| Change shared brand base tokens | clients primarily | `packages/styles/base.css` |

After substantive changes, run `pnpm lint` and `pnpm typecheck` from the monorepo root (or filter to one app with `pnpm turbo typecheck --filter=@vantage/clients`).
